<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh bourses closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh bourses closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-05-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh's bourses - the main Dhaka Stock Exchange (DSE) and the Chittagong Stock Exchange - were closed for a public holiday marking the Shi'ite Moslem festival of Ashura.</p>
<p>The DSE all-share price index rose 44.88 points or 3.92 percent on a turnover of 87.6 million taka at the close of trading on Saturday. Friday is the weekend in Moslem Bangladesh.</p>
<p>-- Dhaka Newsroom +880-2-506363</p>
